<title>NETHERLANDS: KLM details Q1 revenues and costs.</title>
<headline>KLM details Q1 revenues and costs.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>First qtr 1997/98 to June 30.</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>OPERATING REVENUES</p>
<p>    KLM passenger traffic (billions) 1.98  vs    1.59</p>
<p>    KLM cargo traffic		     471     vs  407</p>
<p>Traffic revenues of other</p>
<p>    consolidated companies		428     vs  146</p>
<p>    Other revenue			   387     vs  306</p>
<p>    Total revenues (billions)	     3.26  vs    2.45</p>
<p>OPERATING COSTS</p>
<p>    Salaries/benefits		     825     vs  717</p>
<p>    Aircraft fuel			   322     vs  245</p>
<p>    Materials/consumables		 186     vs  131</p>
<p>    Commercial costs			300     vs  242</p>
<p>    Landing/navigation charges	  267     vs  203</p>
<p>    Third-party handling costs	  113     vs   83</p>
<p>    Work by third parties		 190     vs  165</p>
<p>    Depreciation			    195     vs  217</p>
<p>    Operational lease expenses	   76     vs   31</p>
<p>    Miscellaneous			   546     vs  339</p>
<p>    Total (billions)			  3.02  vs    2.37</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
